{"nodes": [{"id": "wiki_decisions_ai-export-versioned-snapshot-boundary", "label": "Backend-owned versioned AI snapshots with a frontend-owned safe prompt and clipboard boundary", "description": "Resolved decision (updated 2026-08-03): backend owns authoritative facts, profiles, and security; frontend owns instructions, locale, notes, rendering, and clipboard. 54 deterministic profiles, fail-closed catalog, hard cutover. Final hardening approved 3 August 2026: empty temporal rows omitted only when completely empty; Broker universes named explicitly (accessible/scoped/position/period-contributor); targeted run 20260801T085820.657238Z designated as final evidence. Applied-policy run 20260803T164514.504966Z validates Standard 21-day/min-10 policy. Dense exports: 20k/60k warning; no automatic cap. IT/FR/ES User Guide translations explicitly deferred.", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "wiki/decisions/ai-export-versioned-snapshot-boundary.md", "source_location": "L1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "concept_broker_universe_nomenclature_accessible_scoped_position_period", "label": "Explicit Broker Universe Nomenclature: accessible_broker_count / scoped_broker_count / position_broker_count / period_contributor_broker_count", "description": "Four distinct Broker universe counts: accessible_broker_count is the authorization universe; scoped_broker_count/broker_scope is the effective calculation universe; position_broker_count counts Brokers with open positions at snapshot date; period_contributor_broker_count counts period-performance contributors. The Entity Directory follows effective scoped Brokers including a scoped Broker with no current position row. Approved on 3 August 2026; validated by targeted run 20260801T085820.657238Z.", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "wiki/decisions/ai-export-versioned-snapshot-boundary.md", "source_location": "## Decision", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "concept_dense_export_60k_warning_no_automatic_cap", "label": "Dense Portfolio/Broker Export: 60k Token UI Warning Without Automatic Cap or Detail Downgrade", "description": "Dense Portfolio and Broker exports may exceed 60,000 estimated tokens. The existing 20k/60k frontend UI warning remains the user control. Density must not be replaced by an automatic cap, hidden truncation, or automatic detail downgrade. Prompt-size severity is advisory: large complete exports remain copyable after the warning flow. Validated by applied-policy run 20260803T164514.504966Z.", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "wiki/decisions/ai-export-versioned-snapshot-boundary.md", "source_location": "## Consequences", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "concept_deferred_it_fr_es_user_guide_translations", "label": "Deferred IT/FR/ES User Guide Translations: English Remains Current Source", "description": "IT/FR/ES User Guide translations for AI Export are explicitly deferred. English domain manuals are the current authoritative source. The book link uses the current domain's English manual or the localized shared fallback. Documentation closure explicitly records the deferral as a resolved follow-up, not a forgotten item.", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "wiki/decisions/ai-export-versioned-snapshot-boundary.md", "source_location": "## Validation / Success Criteria", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "wiki_decisions_ai-export-versioned-snapshot-boundary", "target": "concept_empty_temporal_row_hardening_public_renderer", "relation": "contains", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "wiki/decisions/ai-export-versioned-snapshot-boundary.md", "source_location": "## Decision", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "wiki_decisions_ai-export-versioned-snapshot-boundary", "target": "concept_broker_universe_nomenclature_ac